NAME
    gcloud beta app-lifecycle-manager flags revisions - manage App Lifecycle
        Manager flags revisions

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta app-lifecycle-manager flags revisions COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA)

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        (BETA) Create Flag Revision.

     delete
        (BETA) Delete Flag Revision.

     describe
        (BETA) Describe Flag Revision.

     list
        (BETA) List Flag Revisions.

     update
        (BETA) Update Flag Revision.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice.

